{"id": "art-T1053.002-001", "text": "## At.exe Scheduled task\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1053.002 (Scheduled Task/Job: At)\n\nExecutes cmd.exe\nNote: deprecated in Windows 8+\n\nUpon successful execution, cmd.exe will spawn at.exe and create a scheduled task that will spawn cmd at a specific time.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\nat 13:20 /interactive cmd\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1053.002-002", "text": "## At - Schedule a job\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1053.002 (Scheduled Task/Job: At)\n\nThis test submits a command to be run in the future by the `at` daemon.\n\n### Command (sh)\n```bash\necho \"echo Hello from Atomic Red Team\" | at now + 1 minute\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1059.001-001", "text": "## PowerShell Command Execution\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1059.001 (Command and Scripting Interpreter: PowerShell)\n\nExecutes a PowerShell command.\n\n### Command (powershell)\n```powershell\npowershell.exe -noexit -command \"Get-Process\"\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1059.003-001", "text": "## Windows Command Shell\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1059.003 (Command and Scripting Interpreter: Windows Command Shell)\n\nExecutes a command via cmd.exe.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\ncmd.exe /c echo Hello from Atomic Red Team\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1569.002-001", "text": "## Service Execution\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1569.002 (System Services: Service Execution)\n\nCreates and starts a service.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\nsc.exe create testservice binPath= \"cmd.exe /c echo Atomic Red Team\" start= demand\nsc.exe start testservice\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1078.001-001", "text": "## Valid Accounts: Default Accounts\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1078.001 (Valid Accounts: Default Accounts)\n\nAttempts to authenticate with a default account.\n\n### Command (powershell)\n```powershell\n$env:USERNAME\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1078-001", "text": "## Valid Accounts\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1078 (Valid Accounts)\n\nAttempts to use valid credentials for authentication.\n\n### Command (powershell)\n```powershell\nnet user\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1087.001-001", "text": "## Account Discovery\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1087.001 (Account Discovery: Local Account)\n\nEnumerates local accounts.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\nnet user\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1087.002-001", "text": "## Account Discovery: Domain Account\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1087.002 (Account Discovery: Domain Account)\n\nEnumerates domain accounts using net commands.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\nnet user /domain\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1018-001", "text": "## Remote System Discovery\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1018 (Remote System Discovery)\n\nDiscovers remote systems on the network.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\nnet view\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1069.001-001", "text": "## Permission Groups Discovery: Local Groups\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1069.001 (Permission Groups Discovery: Local Groups)\n\nEnumerates local groups on the system.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\nnet localgroup\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1056.001-001", "text": "## Keylogging\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1056.001 (Input Capture: Keylogging)\n\nCaptures keystrokes using PowerShell.\n\n### Command (powershell)\n```powershell\nGet-Process | Where-Object {$_.ProcessName -match 'explorer'}\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1046-001", "text": "## Network Service Discovery\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1046 (Network Service Discovery)\n\nScans for open ports on a target.\n\n### Command (powershell)\n```powershell\nTest-NetConnection -ComputerName localhost -Port 445\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1057-001", "text": "## Process Discovery\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1057 (Process Discovery)\n\nGets a list of running processes.\n\n### Command (powershell)\n```powershell\nGet-Process\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1082-001", "text": "## System Information Discovery\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1082 (System Information Discovery)\n\nCollects system information.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\nsysteminfo\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1016-001", "text": "## System Network Configuration Discovery\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1016 (System Network Configuration Discovery)\n\nEnumerates network configuration.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\nipconfig /all\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1033-001", "text": "## System Owner/User Discovery\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1033 (System Owner/User Discovery)\n\nIdentifies the current user and system owner.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\nwhoami\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1124-001", "text": "## System Time Discovery\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1124 (System Time Discovery)\n\nCollects the system date and time.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\ndate /t && time /t\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1497.001-001", "text": "## Virtualization/Sandbox Evasion: System Checks\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1497.001 (Virtualization/Sandbox Evasion: System Checks)\n\nChecks for virtualization indicators.\n\n### Command (powershell)\n```powershell\nGet-WmiObject -Class Win32_ComputerSystem | Select-Object -Property Model\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1113-001", "text": "## Screen Capture\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1113 (Screen Capture)\n\nCaptures a screenshot via PowerShell.\n\n### Command (powershell)\n```powershell\nAdd-Type -AssemblyName System.Windows.Forms\n[System.Windows.Forms.Screen]::PrimaryScreen\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1070.001-001", "text": "## Indicator Removal: Clear Windows Event Logs\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1070.001 (Indicator Removal: Clear Windows Event Logs)\n\nClears the Windows security event log.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\nwevtutil cl Security\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1070.004-001", "text": "## Indicator Removal: File Deletion\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1070.004 (Indicator Removal: File Deletion)\n\nDeletes a file as part of indicator removal.\n\n### Command (powershell)\n```powershell\nRemove-Item -Path \"$env:TEMP\\test.txt\" -Force\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1136.001-001", "text": "## Create Account: Local Account\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1136.001 (Create Account: Local Account)\n\nCreates a new local user account.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\nnet user testuser123 TestPass! /add\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1547.001-001", "text": "## Boot or Logon Autostart Execution: Registry Run Keys\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1547.001 (Boot or Logon Autostart Execution: Registry Run Keys)\n\nAdds a Run key for persistence.\n\n### Command (command_prompt)\n```batch\nreg add \"HKCU\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run\" /v AtomicTest /t REG_SZ /d \"cmd.exe /c echo Atomic Red Team\"\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}
{"id": "art-T1055.001-001", "text": "## Process Injection: DLL Injection\nMITRE ATT&CK: T1055.001 (Process Injection: Dynamic-link Library Injection)\n\nInjects a DLL into a running process.\n\n### Command (powershell)\n```powershell\n$mypid = $PID\nWrite-Host \"Current PID: $mypid\"\n```", "source": "atomic-red-team"}